# Solver Determinism

When the solver is implemented (DND-1.4):

- Identical inputs must produce identical outputs.
- Do not rely on wall-clock time or unordered iteration for results.
- Keep AI out of the critical solve path.

DND-1.1 must not implement the solver, candidate generation, or adaptive reflow.
